	<p>Ponder this. Do you think Google, who charges businesses to be on the first page, will continue to allow businesses who don’t pay them, to be front and centre on their first page for much longer?</p>
<p>The moral of the story is either you need to pay Google to be at the top of their first page or be the best business, (as voted by your customers with the best reviews) with the best website, in your industry and area.</p>
