	<p>Have you ever searched for a product or service and seen the Googles paid ads that come up at the top of the search are not relevant to your search? Well, simply put, that’s down to bad Google Ads management. Our simple pledge is, your Ad will be the perfect match for the relevant search…..no prospects thinking why have I been shown an ad for a local florist, when I’m actually searching for a wholesale flower provider?!?</p>
